0..74 Comment "// The wildcard: `_` written where a value is read stands for the term the"
75..148 Comment "// equations force (#528). The elaborator answers it, not the author: the"
149..223 Comment "// solver binds it only where a comparison forces a most general solution,"
224..301 Comment "// the checker writes that solution in its place, and the kernel readmits the"
302..370 Comment "// declaration as if the term were written by hand. A wildcard in an"
371..445 Comment "// ascription\'s type is forced by the term it ascribes. A hole `?h` is the"
446..485 Comment "// author\'s to fill. What refuses is in"
486..531 Comment "// `../../pathological/holes/wildcard.gandr`."
